  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">High Level Panel for a Sustainable Ocean Economy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ocean Panel members (17) has put forward a new ocean action agenda underpinned by sustainably managing 100% of national water. This project (phase 2) aims to support the countries, and in particular developing countries, in their process towards and implementation of the 100% ocean management commitment and make advancements on the ocean action agenda as spelled out in the &quot;Transformation to a sustainable ocean Economy&quot; (2020).</narrative>
  </description>
